SetupBodyKatTest
├── when reading back every vector's encoding
│   └── it should return the vector's wait, pause choice and every credential at its place, and revert one place past the end.
├── when decoding every vector's encoding
│   └── it should return the vector's wait, pause choice and clauses, and every credential at its place from the decoded clauses.
├── when no place of any vector is filled
│   └── it should fail naming clause zero.
├── when every place of the two clause vector is filled
│   └── it should return true naming no failing clause.
├── when a place is filled past the end of the empty clauses vector
│   └── it should fail naming clause zero.
├── when the test encoder encodes every vector's input
│   └── it should reproduce the expected encoding.
└── when the library encoder encodes every vector's input
    └── it should reproduce the expected encoding.
